      "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-4vw\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Events</span></span>",
      "line2": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">Your opportunity to learn is here.</span></span><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><br>\r\n</span></span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5-vw\">Every day, your goal is to be the best surgeon you can be. And our goal is to help you. With a commitment to clinical innovation, we’re constantly working to develop industry-leading devices and technology to give you and your patients the best possible outcomes. Our courses offer educational and hands-on skills training on our Stryker products.</span></p>\r\n",
